{
  "Combat.Dullahan.Counter": "The Dullahan expertly parries and counters your attack, damaging you! ({0:0})"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Determination.First": "\"Did you expect me to just lay down and accept your blade? No. Despite my appearance, I do not welcome death. You, however, seem to court it!\""
  "Combat.Dullahan.Determination.Heal": " (+{0:0} HP)"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Determination.Line": "The dullahan seems even more focused than before!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Determination.Second": "\"I've suffered too much to fall here. Too much. I will not!\""
  "Combat.Dullahan.Disarm.Failed": "Despite her efforts, you win the struggle, and keep your weapon."
  "Combat.Dullahan.Disarm.Intro": "The Dullahan charges at you and strikes, but her blade does not target you. She clashes it with your weapon, sliding her blade down to the grip and then pulling on it fiercely!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Disarm.Success": "She manages to pull your weapon from your hands, throwing it far from your reach!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Disarm.Taunt": "The dullahan moves back and looks at you, mockingly. \"Pick it up.\""
  "Combat.Dullahan.Fear.Normal": "The Dullahan laughs excessively at your attempts. \"You cannot frighten DEATH itself!\" she screams. Although her voice cracks as she tries to make it sound deeper, she is actually unaffected by your attempt!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Fear.Rude": "\"You know the things I've seen. No petty illusion can overwhelm those corporeal nightmares.\""
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Blind": ", and you step away as you watch the Dullahan's blind attacks strike only air."
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Block": ", and you manage to raise your shield in time to block the rest of her flurry!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Damage": " ({0:0} damage)"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Evade": ", and you dodge the rest of the flurry, thanks to your incredible evasive ability!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Feint": ", but it was a feint! You dodge into a position perfect for her to strike, and she hits you multiple times before you can back off to safety!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Flexibility": ", and the rest also fail to hit as you bend and contort to barely dodge her strikes!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Intro": "The Dullahan rears back for a moment, and dashes forward with a flurry of slashes! The first attack is oddly easy to dodge"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Misdirection": ", and you counter her feint with your own practiced misdirection, avoiding all hits!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Parry": ", and you manage to parry the rest with your weapon."
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Speed": ", and you successfully dodge her follow-up attacks!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Flurry.Unhandled": ", and you successfully dodge her follow-up attacks!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Horror.Failed": " You cower as she morphs into a tall, revolting and horrifying specter, wailing the cries of the dead in an unknowable tongue.\\\nBy the gods, you have picked a fight with the horseman of the dead, an unknowable entity of oblivion! You can't face such a foe, it's impossible, it's madness itself!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Horror.Intro": "The Dullahan dashes back, and covers itself completely in its cloak. She turns around, as if preparing something.\\\nWhen you decide to attack, you're surprised as she turns around, holding her head on her left hand, pointing at you with the other. She screams in a terrifying voice as her eyes glow with a menacing purple light."
  "Combat.Dullahan.Horror.LineNormal": " \"I, the horseman of the dead, am here to claim your soul!\""
  "Combat.Dullahan.Horror.LineRude": " \"The abyss is vast, and it awaits us all. Welcome it. This is what you've asked for.\""
  "Combat.Dullahan.Horror.Resisted": " You focus as she begins morphing into a tall, revolting and horrifying specter.\\\nWith some effort, you see past her illusion. The Dullahan notices, and appears to be flustered for a moment as she reattaches her head and returns to a combat stance."
  "Combat.Dullahan.PickUpWeapon": "You run desperately over to your weapon and grab it. The Dullahan stays silent, with a clear look of disapproval."
  "Combat.Dullahan.Pommel.Dodged": "You manage to dodge the peculiar attack without any harm."
  "Combat.Dullahan.Pommel.Hit": "The pommel bashes powerfully against your skull, causing way more pain than you expected such a blow to."
  "Combat.Dullahan.Pommel.Intro": "The dullahan charges at you with her sword. You prepare to defend, but at the last second, she switches her attack direction, shoving the pommel of her saber downwards, towards your head!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Pommel.Stunned": " You're left stunned by the concussive force of the attack!"
  "Combat.Dullahan.Run": "The knight stares and laughs ominously as you run away."
  "Combat.Dullahan.Stun.BodyKeepsGoing": "Despite the Dullahan's head clearly being disoriented, the body still continues to act, though it isn't very precise due to lacking sight and hearing."
  "Combat.Dullahan.Stun.Determined": "\"Not... good enough!\" The Dullahan finds more determination and recovers from her daze!"
}
